1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,530
This one's rare. This one's medium-well. Go!
這是三分熟 這是五分熟，快去吧

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,630
Hey, Phoebe! How was dinner?!
菲比，晚餐好吃嗎？

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,430
Dinner was good! Just saying hi! Now I'm gonna go!
晚餐很好吃，我只是來打招呼 我要走了

4
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:14,810
-Well, hello there. -Hi.
-你好 -嗨

5
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:17,670
I didn't see this on the menu.
我在菜單上沒有看到這個

6
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:20,870
Tim, this is Phoebe. Phoebe, this is Tim, my new sous chef.
提姆，她是菲比 菲比，他是我的新二廚提姆

7
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,480
-So you're Monica's boss? -No, she's my boss.
-你是摩妮卡的老闆 -不，她是我的老闆

8
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:27,380
-"Sous" is French for "under." -I "sous-stand."
-「二」在法文裡是「之下」的意思 -我「瞭解」了

9
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:32,690
Tim, I need a calamari and a caesar salad. And could you get me the pesto?
提姆，我要一份烏賊跟一份凱撒沙拉 你可以給我青醬嗎？

10
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:35,460
-You made pesto? -Yes, I did.
-青醬是你做的？ -沒錯

11
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:38,760
Would you say your pesto is the best-o?
你覺得你的青醬 是最棒的？

12
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:42,390
I don't know. I would say it's pretty good-o.
我不知道 我會說它真的很棒

13
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,930
I still need the calamari and salad.
我還是需要烏賊跟沙拉

14
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,800
I like your necklace.
我喜歡你的項鏈

15
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:52,740
"Coming up, Monica. I have to obey you, otherwise the system breaks down."
「馬上來，摩妮卡，我得服從你 不然的話系統會瓦解」

16
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:56,250
"l know that." "Then why are we having this conversation? "
「我知道」，「那麼我們為什麼 還要談這些？」

17
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:58,910
-I made it myself. -You are so talented.
-那是我自己做的 -你真的好有天份

18
00:00:59,090 --> 00:01:01,320
Well, it's no pesto.
那不是青醬

19
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:05,750
Let's just cut to the chase. You're single. You're single.
我們就別玩遊戲了 你是單身，你也單身

20
00:01:05,930 --> 00:01:08,830
He gets off work at 11. She'll be waiting for your call.
他11點下班 她會等你的電話

21
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,030
I'll give him your number if I could just get one calamari and one caesar salad!
快給我烏賊跟凱撒沙拉 我就會給他你的電話號碼

22
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:19,770
I did not yell. I am not putting a dollar in the jar.
我沒有大叫 我不必被罰一塊錢

23
00:01:20,847 --> 00:01:23,042
The One With Rachels Date
本集播出：瑞秋的男友

00:01:24,847 --> 00:01:25,842
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

24
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:04,850
-Wow, Bing! Burning the midnight oil. -You know me, sir.
-賓，你還在熬夜加班 -你很瞭解我的，老闆

25
00:02:05,590 --> 00:02:09,110
Do you know how I can get around the office computer network..
你知道要怎麼避過 辦公室的電腦網路…

26
00:02:09,290 --> 00:02:12,350
so I can access the really good Internet porn?
進去網際網路看 超級精彩的黃色電影嗎？

27
00:02:13,630 --> 00:02:15,760
You're a joker, Bing.
你真愛開玩笑，賓

28
00:02:17,270 --> 00:02:19,260
What's funny about that?
那有什麼好笑的？

29
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:24,800
-Sorry I kept you waiting so long. -That's okay. Where do you wanna go?
-抱歉讓你等這麼久 -沒關係，你想去哪裡？

30
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:27,010
I think you know where I wanna go.
我以為你知道我要去哪裡

31
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:29,740
-The Hard Rock Cafe? -Yeah.
-硬石餐廳？ -對

32
00:02:30,180 --> 00:02:32,580
-Again? -Yeah.
-又要去？ -對

33
00:02:33,650 --> 00:02:38,110
-I'm telling you, I like the food. -You like the Purple Rain display.
-我真的很喜歡那裡的食物 -你喜歡那裡的紫雨展示品

34
00:02:39,750 --> 00:02:43,090
-Hey, Bob. -Hey, Toby. Have a good night.
-嗨，巴伯 -嗨，托比，祝你今晚玩得開心

35
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:48,990
-Did that guy just call you Toby? -Yeah, he thinks that's my name.
-那傢伙叫你托比？ -對，他以為那是我的名字

36
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:54,060
-Why don't you correct him? -It's been going on way too long now.
-你為什麼不更正他？ -那是很久以前的事了

37
00:02:54,370 --> 00:02:57,830
The first time, we were just passing each other, so I didn't say anything.
第一次我們錯身而過 所以我什麼都沒說

38
00:02:58,010 --> 00:03:01,370
The next time he said, "Toby, want a doughnut?"
第二次他說 「托比，你要吃甜甜圈嗎？」

39
00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:04,270
I wanted the doughnut.
我想吃甜甜圈

40
00:03:04,950 --> 00:03:08,910
Five years later, the doughnut's gone and I'm still Toby.
五年後甜甜圈早就消化光了 我還是托比

42
00:03:09,150 --> 00:03:13,280
-Chandler, you have to tell him. -That would be so awkward.
-錢德，你得告訴他 -那一定會很可怕

43
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:16,790
We don't work together. He's on the sixth floor.
我們不在同一個樓層工作 他在六樓

44
00:03:16,990 --> 00:03:19,930
So he calls me Toby once in a while.
他每隔一陣子會叫我托比

45
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:22,860
It's not like he's calling me Muriel.
反正他不是叫我馬利歐

46
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:27,800
Muriel. Why would he call you Muriel?
馬利歐 他為什麼要叫你馬利歐？

47
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:33,670
Oh, my God.
天啊

48
00:03:34,380 --> 00:03:37,870
Chandler "M." Bing.
錢德·M·賓？

49
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:43,910
It's not just an "M." Your middle name is Muriel!
事實上不是M 你的中間名是馬利歐

50
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:46,810
It is a family name.
那是家族名字

51
00:03:47,020 --> 00:03:50,820
Chandler Muriel Bing.
錢德·馬利歐·賓

52
00:03:51,090 --> 00:03:55,590
Your parents never even gave you a chance, did they?
你父母真的 不給你任何機會，對吧？

53
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:59,860
Drake, I've discovered the reason for your memory loss.
德瑞克 我找出你喪失記憶的原因了

54
00:04:00,030 --> 00:04:01,090
What is it?
為什麼？

55
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:04,270
Your brain transplant wasn't successful.
你的腦部移植手術失敗

56
00:04:04,510 --> 00:04:07,340
Your body's rejecting Jessica's brain.
你的身體排斥潔西卡的腦部

57
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:09,700
Is it serious?
很嚴重嗎？

58
00:04:09,980 --> 00:04:12,410
Not if we extract tissue from the original body..
如果我們可以從捐贈者的身體 抽取組織…

59
00:04:12,580 --> 00:04:18,540
and synthesize antibodies to stop you from rejecting the brain.
合成抗生素 阻止你排斥移植來的腦部

60
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:22,420
That sounds simple enough. Let's just do that.
聽起來很簡單 我們就那麼做吧

61
00:04:22,620 --> 00:04:26,460
We would, but when we went to exhume Jessica's body..
我們可以那麼做 但我們想挖出潔西卡的屍體時…

62
00:04:26,660 --> 00:04:28,960
it was gone.
發現它不見了

63
00:04:33,030 --> 00:04:34,630
Very nice, people.
非常不錯，大伙們

64
00:04:34,870 --> 00:04:37,000
I'll change and we can go.
我換了衣服後我們就能離開

65
00:04:37,210 --> 00:04:41,730
-What happened to Jessica's body? -You'll have to see it on TV.
-潔西卡的屍體怎麼了？ -你得看電視才會知道

66
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:45,000
-You don't know, do you? -Couldn't care less.
-你不知道，對吧？ -我也不在乎

67
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:49,180
-Good scene, man. -You too.
-你表現的很好 -你也是

68
00:04:51,850 --> 00:04:54,580
What? You weren't in it.
什麼？你根本不是演員

69
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:59,750
Kash, this is my friend Rachel. Rachel, Kash.
凱許，她是我朋友瑞秋 瑞秋，凱許

70
00:04:59,990 --> 00:05:03,860
-Hi. -Why haven't I seen you here before?
-嗨 -為什麼之前我沒有見過你？

71
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:10,030
Joey just thinks I'll embarrass him. He thinks I'm a soap opera nut.
喬伊覺得我會丟他的臉 他認為我是肥皂劇迷

72
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:12,540
Which I'm not. I'm not.
我才不是 真的

73
00:05:12,970 --> 00:05:18,070
Although, I do know your favorite ice cream flavor is butter pecan.
雖然我真的知道 你最喜歡胡桃奶油口味的冰淇淋

74
00:05:19,010 --> 00:05:22,740
And your dog's name is Wally.
你的狗叫做華利

75
00:05:23,050 --> 00:05:26,280
-Look, I'm just stroking your arm. -Here we go.
-天啊，我在摸你的手 -我們走吧

76
00:05:26,550 --> 00:05:29,520
Bye, Kash. Say hi to Wally.
再見，凱許 幫我跟華利問好

78
00:05:34,230 --> 00:05:35,920
-Monica. -Hi.
-摩妮卡 -嗨

79
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:41,130
I had the best time with Tim last night. He is so sweet.
昨晚我跟提姆玩得很開心 他真的很體貼

80
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:44,030
I can't wait to get "sous-neath" him.
我等不及 鑽到他的身體下面去

81
00:05:46,010 --> 00:05:48,000
-I have to fire him. -Why?
-我得開除他 -為什麼？

82
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:51,580
He's terrible. He's slow. He burns things.
他真的很可怕 他的動作超慢，還會把食物燒焦

83
00:05:51,810 --> 00:05:54,510
He lit my pastry chef on fire.
他放火燒我的甜點主廚

84
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:58,010
He was nervous. You can be intimidating.
他太緊張了 你老是凶巴巴的

85
00:05:58,220 --> 00:06:02,050
And your pastry chef can stand to be taken down a peg.
你的甜點主廚毛髮應該可以少一點

86
00:06:02,260 --> 00:06:05,950
Well, now she has no eyebrows. Mission accomplished.
現在她沒有眉毛 任務完成

87
00:06:06,230 --> 00:06:09,460
But, Monica, he loves his job so much.
但摩妮卡，他熱愛他的工作

88
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:13,430
Can't you just give him another chance, please?
你不能再給他一次機會嗎？ 拜託

89
00:06:14,900 --> 00:06:18,000
All right. But if he lights someone else on fire, he's gone.
好吧，但如果他再放火燒別人 他非走不可

90
00:06:18,170 --> 00:06:21,870
That's fair. Thank you so much.
那很公平，謝謝你

91
00:06:22,910 --> 00:06:25,810
Looks like he got you a little bit too.
看起來 他也燒到你了

92
00:06:26,450 --> 00:06:29,080
I paid to have this done.
我付錢把頭髮弄成這樣

93
00:06:31,420 --> 00:06:33,440
Love it!
我喜歡

94
00:06:36,460 --> 00:06:40,550
Hey. You know, Kash really liked you.
知道嗎？ 凱許真的喜歡你

95
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,850
He thought you were charming.
他覺得你很迷人

96
00:06:43,130 --> 00:06:47,120
-I thought I was an idiot. -I'm with you.
-我以為我是個白癡 -我贊成

97
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:53,660
-He asked if you'd go out with him. -I think I'm gonna throw up a little.
-他問你願不願意跟他約會 -我想我得去吐一下

98
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:56,000
-What did you say? -"No."
-你怎麼說？ -「不」

99
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:58,070
What?
什麼？

100
00:06:58,280 --> 00:07:03,480
I figured since you're pregnant, you're not gonna be seeing people.
我想因為你懷孕了 你不能跟別人約會

101
00:07:04,590 --> 00:07:09,110
First of all, Kash Ford? Not people.
首先，他是凱許福特 不是一般人

102
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:11,880
Did you tell him I was pregnant?
你告訴他我懷孕了嗎？

103
00:07:12,130 --> 00:07:17,890
No. I didn't know if you told people. This was when Kash was still "people."
不，我不知道你要不要告訴別人 這時候的凱許是「一般人」

104
00:07:18,130 --> 00:07:21,900
-Good. Just have him call me. -I don't think that's..
-很好，請他打電話給我 -我不覺得…

105
00:07:22,140 --> 00:07:26,840
Go do it or I'll come back to that set. I'll meet more actors.
照我的話做，不然我會回到攝影棚 泡其他的男演員

106
00:07:29,010 --> 00:07:32,240
-Hey, Bob. -How's my pal Toby doing today?
-嘿，巴伯 -我朋友托比今天還好嗎？

107
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:35,380
If I see him, I'll ask.
我看到他時會幫你問一下

108
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:41,980
Was that Bob from six you were just talking to?
你剛剛在跟 六樓的巴伯說話？

109
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:43,920
-Yeah. -You know him?
-對 -你認識他？

110
00:07:44,190 --> 00:07:46,630
We're on a semi-first-name basis.
我們會互叫彼此的名字

111
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:51,660
-What about adding him to our team? -Bob?
-如果他加入我們的團隊呢？ -巴伯嗎？

112
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:57,840
Working here with us? Every day? I don't know if he has what it takes.
每天跟我們在這裡一起工作？ 我不知道他有沒有那個能耐

113
00:07:58,070 --> 00:08:01,870
-They love him down on six. -But this is 11.
-六樓的人很喜歡他 -但這裡是11樓

114
00:08:02,140 --> 00:08:05,240
It's almost twice as hard up here.
這裡的工作要難上兩倍

115
00:08:05,450 --> 00:08:09,380
-Okay, Bob will stay put. -I think it's best, sir.
-好吧，巴伯還是不能調職 -我想那麼做是最好的

116
00:08:09,650 --> 00:08:13,310
We do need to find somebody. Work is starting to pile up.
我們真的很缺人 工作開始越積越多了

117
00:08:13,490 --> 00:08:16,690
I've got a stack of documents this high.
我有一疊文件 已經疊到這麼高了

118
00:08:16,890 --> 00:08:21,290
Just toss them in the shredder and claim you never got them.
把它們丟到碎紙機裡 就說你從來沒有收到它們

119
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:24,460
That's a good one, Bing.
那真的很好笑，賓

120
00:08:24,970 --> 00:08:29,560
What does a guy have to do to be taken seriously around here?
我該怎麼做 他們才會覺得我是認真的？

121
00:08:34,410 --> 00:08:38,170
I gave him another chance, but Tim has got to go.
我再給他一次機會 但提姆非走不可

122
00:08:38,380 --> 00:08:41,910
I called the chef who recommended him to me.
我打電話 給推薦他給我的廚師

123
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:45,450
He said, "Ha, ha! Gotcha!"
他說「哈，哈，整到你了」

124
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:48,450
-But don't fire him today. -Why?
-但別在今天開除他 -為什麼？

125
00:08:48,690 --> 00:08:52,590
-Because I'm dumping him today. -You said he was sweet.
-因為今天我要甩掉他 -你說他很體貼

126
00:08:52,790 --> 00:08:56,630
He's too sweet. He calls me all the time.
他太體貼了 他老是打電話給我

127
00:08:56,900 --> 00:09:00,430
"Did you get home okay? Was your shower okay?"
「你平安回家了嗎？ 你的洗澡水夠熱嗎？」

128
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:03,360
-Don't pick up the phone. -Then he comes over!
-別接電話 -他會親自過來

129
00:09:03,540 --> 00:09:06,940
"I was so worried about you." Be a man!
「我好擔心你」 有點男子氣概吧

130
00:09:07,610 --> 00:09:09,510
So I can't fire him?
所以我不能開除他？

131
00:09:09,740 --> 00:09:12,980
And dump him the same day? He'll kill himself.
讓他在同一天被甩？ 他會自殺的

132
00:09:13,180 --> 00:09:15,650
I'll fire him, and you go out with him another week.
我開除他 你再跟他交往一星期

133
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:19,720
Are you kidding? Another week with that simp, I'll kill myself.
你在開玩笑嗎？ 再跟他交往一個星期，我會自殺的

134
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:23,220
We'll both do it today and he'll just have to deal with it.
我們都在今天跟他攤牌 他得自己想辦法應付

135
00:09:23,930 --> 00:09:29,660
Okay. But who's gonna go first? Whoever goes second is the bitch.
好吧，但誰要先說呢？ 第二個說的人就是臭女人

136
00:09:29,930 --> 00:09:33,030
-What? -Fire a guy that's just been dumped?
-什麼？ -開除一個剛剛被甩的男人？

137
00:09:33,300 --> 00:09:36,860
Bitch! And dump a guy that's just been fired?
臭女人 甩掉一個剛剛被開除的男人？

138
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:39,000
Blond bitch!
金髮臭女人

139
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:43,680
I wanted to do this days ago, so I think I should go first.
我幾天前就想這麼做 所以我想應該讓我先說

140
00:09:43,950 --> 00:09:46,280
All right, that makes sense.
好吧，你說的有理

141
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:50,520
But screw you! I'm going first!
但去你的，我要先說

142
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:57,250
-Toby, you got a sec? -Sure. What's up?
-托比，你有空嗎？ -當然，什麼事？

143
00:09:57,490 --> 00:10:02,390
I wanted to get transferred up here, but it's not gonna happen.
我想被調職到這裡來 但我的美夢破滅

144
00:10:02,660 --> 00:10:07,000
Apparently somebody thinks I'm not "11th-floor material."
很明顯地有人認為 我不是「11樓的材料」

145
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:11,370
Say, who the hell is this Chandler?
錢德到底是誰？

146
00:10:13,370 --> 00:10:17,330
What's the best excuse for why I'm not drinking on this date tonight?
今晚約會時 哪個借口最適合我用來擋酒？

147
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:20,550
"I'm a recovering alcoholic, " "I'm a Mormon"..
「我正在戒酒」 「我是摩門教徒」…

148
00:10:20,820 --> 00:10:25,150
or "I got so hammered last night I'm still a little drunk"?
或是「我昨晚喝太醉 現在還在宿醉」？

149
00:10:25,350 --> 00:10:27,250
You're not gonna tell him you're pregnant?
你不打算告訴他 你懷孕了？

150
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:31,020
I don't think so. Books say wait till the third date to tell the guy..
我想還是不要吧，書上說 等到第三次約會再告訴你的對象…

151
00:10:31,190 --> 00:10:33,250
you got something growing in your uterus.
你的勝子裡 有個東西在成長

152
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:36,090
-Hey. -Hi.
-嘿 -嗨

153
00:10:36,260 --> 00:10:38,860
What do you want to do tonight?
今晚你要做什麼？

154
00:10:39,100 --> 00:10:43,160
There's a powerful Ukrainian film playing. Interested?
有出很棒的烏克蘭電影 你想看嗎？

155
00:10:43,370 --> 00:10:47,770
No. But I'll go see a normal-person movie with you.
不，但我可以陪你 看一般人看的電影

156
00:10:48,010 --> 00:10:52,110
-Rach, you wanna come? -I can't. I've got a date.
-瑞秋，你要一起來嗎？ -不行，我有約會

157
00:10:52,810 --> 00:10:55,980
-A date? -Yeah. Why, is that weird for you?
-約會？ -對，怎麼了？很奇怪嗎？

158
00:10:56,180 --> 00:11:00,980
Why, no. It's the opposite of weird. It's regular.
不，一點都不奇怪 那很正常

159
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:05,350
It's mundane. It's actually a little dull.
那太普通了 事實上還有點無聊

160
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:08,490
It's no Ukrainian film.
它不是烏克蘭電影

161
00:11:08,700 --> 00:11:10,860
Earrings!
耳環

162
00:11:11,570 --> 00:11:17,330
-She's got a date? With who? -I set her up with this actor.
-她有約會？對方是誰？ -我撮合她跟一個男演員

163
00:11:17,540 --> 00:11:22,270
-You set her up? -No.
-你幫她牽紅線？ -不

164
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:25,710
-What were you thinking? -That it was okay..
-你在想什麼？ -那應該沒關係…

165
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:28,850
because you two haven't dated in five years.
因為你們兩個 已經分手五年了

166
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:34,420
I'm worried about my baby. Whoever she dates, my baby dates.
我擔心我的寶寶 跟她約會的人也在跟我的寶寶約會

167
00:11:34,690 --> 00:11:40,890
-Where is this "actor" taking them? -Hey! I'm an "actor" too.
-這個「男演員」要帶她們去哪裡？ -嘿，我也是男演員

168
00:11:41,900 --> 00:11:45,800
They're taking the ferry to a place on Staten lsland.
他們要搭渡輪 到史坦頓島玩

169
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:52,170
My baby's going on a ferry? Do you have any idea how dangerous those are?
我的寶寶要搭渡輪？ 你知道那有多危險嗎？

170
00:11:52,370 --> 00:11:56,500
Aren't we talking about those big boats that go really slow?
我們是在談 那些速度緩慢的大船吧？

171
00:11:56,710 --> 00:12:02,620
Why not just jump out of an airplane or burn each other with matches?
他們為什麼不去跳飛機 或點火柴把彼此燒了？

172
00:12:06,590 --> 00:12:10,320
-Hey, Joey. -Hey, Kash. Ross, this is Kash.
-嘿，喬伊 -凱許，羅斯，他就是凱許

173
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:13,890
Hey, I hear you're going on a ferry tonight.
我聽說 今晚你們要去搭渡輪

174
00:12:14,130 --> 00:12:16,460
Bit of a daredevil, are we?
我們有點大膽吧？

175
00:12:17,930 --> 00:12:21,600
Do you guys think this is too slutty? Hi, Kash.
這件洋裝是不是太露了？ 嗨，凱許

176
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:26,570
-Hey, Rachel. You ready to go? -Yeah. See you guys later.
-瑞秋，你準備好了嗎？ -是的，待會見

177
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:31,570
Have a great time, you guys. And yes, it is too slutty!
祝你們玩的愉快 那件洋裝的確太露了

178
00:12:37,220 --> 00:12:38,810
Hi.
嗨

179
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,750
Hi.
嗨

180
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:45,050
I'm glad you called. I feel like I'm always calling you.
我很高興你打電話給我 我也覺得自己太黏你了

181
00:12:45,330 --> 00:12:48,300
What's up? Is everything okay with Phoebe?
什麼事？ 菲比沒事吧？

182
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:53,000
It will be in a minute.
我待會就會沒事

183
00:12:53,230 --> 00:12:57,930
-Tim, you're a really great guy. -That's because I'm with you.
-提姆，你真的很棒 -那是因為我跟你在一起

184
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:05,610
It's just, I'm in a place in my life right now where..
但我的人生 現在走到了…

185
00:13:06,580 --> 00:13:09,850
So sorry. "This just in."
抱歉，「剛剛有消息傳過來」

186
00:13:11,050 --> 00:13:13,680
It's the restaurant. Monica needs me right away.
是餐廳在呼叫我 摩妮卡要我馬上趕過去

187
00:13:13,890 --> 00:13:17,550
No, she doesn't! I know what that is. You can stay.
不，不是的，我知道發生了什麼事 你可以留下來

188
00:13:18,130 --> 00:13:20,690
I'll miss you too, Pheebs.
我也會想你的，菲比

189
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:25,700
And I will be holding you right here.
我會把你放在這裡

190
00:13:33,610 --> 00:13:37,570
What movie do you wanna see? And not one I have to read.
你想看哪部電影？ 我不想看那種得認真看字幕的電影

191
00:13:37,780 --> 00:13:39,870
I get that from books.
我受夠看書了

192
00:13:40,950 --> 00:13:44,380
-Books? -Okay, car magazines, cereal boxes..
-書？ -好吧，汽車雜誌，玉米片包裝…

193
00:13:44,590 --> 00:13:45,980
but it's enough!
但那就夠我受的了

194
00:13:46,950 --> 00:13:51,410
Let's not see a movie. We'll just stay here and hang.
我們別去看電影 就待在家裡閒晃吧

195
00:13:51,630 --> 00:13:58,000
-Just wait for Rachel to come back? -Hey, if that's what you wanna do.
-你要等瑞秋回來？ -如果你要那麼做的話

196
00:13:58,230 --> 00:14:00,760
Dude, what is going on?
發生了什麼事？

197
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:04,300
-I have to find out how it went. -Why?
-我得知道他們之間怎麼了 -為什麼？

198
00:14:04,570 --> 00:14:09,810
-He could be my baby's stepfather. -One date and they're getting married?
-他可能是我孩子的繼父 -才約會一次他們就要結婚了？

199
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:12,410
He's not you!
他不是你

200
00:14:13,950 --> 00:14:16,420
I can't believe she's dating!
我不敢相信她去約會了

201
00:14:16,650 --> 00:14:20,980
-What did you think she was gonna do? -I don't know.
-你覺得她該怎麼做呢？ -我不知道

202
00:14:21,260 --> 00:14:25,920
-I can't believe this is happening. -What do you mean?
-我不會相信會發生這種事 -你是什麼意思？

203
00:14:26,130 --> 00:14:30,530
I thought when I had another kid, it'd be different.
我以為我再生個孩子 情況會不一樣

204
00:14:31,130 --> 00:14:36,830
I love Ben. But every time I drop him off at Carol and Susan's..
我愛班 但每次送他到卡蘿跟蘇珊家…

205
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:39,940
it breaks my heart a little.
我都會覺得很傷心

206
00:14:40,610 --> 00:14:44,940
I've always had this picture of me and my next wife in bed..
我一直想像著 我跟未來的太太躺在床上…

207
00:14:45,150 --> 00:14:51,020
my kid comes running in, leaps up on the bed and we all read the paper.
我的孩子跑過來跳到床上 我們會一起看報紙

208
00:14:51,290 --> 00:14:54,520
Maybe fight over the science section.
或許還會搶著看科學版

209
00:14:55,190 --> 00:15:01,420
-That's nice. You can still have that. -No. Rachel's out with some guy.
-那很棒，你還可以擁有那樣的夢想 -不，瑞秋跟別的男人約會

210
00:15:01,630 --> 00:15:04,560
My baby went with her.
我的孩子跟她一起去了

211
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:09,730
If anything, that picture keeps moving further away.
如果出了任何事 那個夢想會離我越來越遠

212
00:15:10,870 --> 00:15:12,860
Hey, can I ask you something?
我能問你一件事嗎？

213
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:19,380
In this picture of you and your wife, is your wife Rachel?
你想像你未來的太太時 她是瑞秋嗎？

214
00:15:20,050 --> 00:15:22,680
It used to be.
以前是的

215
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:27,250
Now she doesn't really have a face.
現在我夢裡的人沒有臉

216
00:15:27,890 --> 00:15:30,760
Smokin' body, though.
但她有很辣的身材

217
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:37,460
Good call. But the face, Ross, the face isn't Rachel.
說的好，但是羅斯 她已經不是瑞秋了

218
00:15:37,670 --> 00:15:41,730
No. But how much easier would it be if it were?
對，但如果是的話 事情會變得很簡單吧？

219
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:44,060
That's not what she wants.
那不是她要的

220
00:15:44,270 --> 00:15:48,330
I know. And I can't force myself to fall in love with her.
我知道 我不能逼自己愛上她

221
00:15:48,540 --> 00:15:51,880
Ross, maybe you need a new picture.
羅斯，或許你需要新夢想

222
00:15:52,110 --> 00:15:55,980
It won't be what you thought. But no matter what..
它會跟你之前的夢想不一樣 但不論如何…

223
00:15:56,220 --> 00:16:00,880
there's gonna be a brand-new little baby. Your baby.
都會有個新寶寶 你的孩子

224
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:04,580
Who cares what the picture looks like?
誰在乎夢想是什麼樣的呢？

225
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:06,660
Yeah.
對

226
00:16:07,530 --> 00:16:10,900
Let's you and me go out and have some fun.
我們一起出去 好好地玩一玩吧

227
00:16:11,130 --> 00:16:13,760
Whatever you want. Come on.
你想做什麼都行，來吧

228
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:19,000
-We can catch that Ukrainian film. -No, I said fun.
-我們還趕得上看烏克蘭電影 -不，我說好玩的事

229
00:16:20,940 --> 00:16:22,740
-Hey, Toby? -Hey, Bobby.
-嘿，托比 -嘿，巴比

230
00:16:23,110 --> 00:16:25,870
It's Bob, actually.
事實上是巴伯

231
00:16:26,580 --> 00:16:31,280
You work up here. Where's Chandler Bing's office?
你在這裡工作 錢德賓的辦公室在哪裡？

232
00:16:31,550 --> 00:16:35,250
Yeah, it's right..
它就在…

233
00:16:36,660 --> 00:16:39,250
Right there. Let me ask you, why?
就在那裡 你問這個做什麼？

234
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:41,930
I wanna talk to that bastard, see what his problem is.
我想跟那個混蛋談 看他有什麼問題

235
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:44,160
Okay, Bob. Listen.
好吧，巴伯，聽我說

236
00:16:45,770 --> 00:16:48,530
I'm the reason you didn't get the job.
是我害你無法調職

237
00:16:48,770 --> 00:16:50,740
-Toby, don't. -Bob.
-托比，不要 -巴伯

238
00:16:50,970 --> 00:16:55,530
Toby, I'm not gonna let you cover for him.
托比，我不會讓你幫他說話

239
00:16:55,780 --> 00:17:00,110
Anything you say will just get me more upset with Chandler.
你說任何話 只會讓我更氣錢德

240
00:17:00,350 --> 00:17:03,680
That puts me in a difficult position.
那真的讓我很兩難

241
00:17:04,620 --> 00:17:07,750
You do anything to Chandler, it's gonna bring you down to his level.
你生錢德的氣 只會讓自己跟他一樣卑鄙

242
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,750
I guess you're right.
我猜你說的對

243
00:17:12,930 --> 00:17:17,260
Don't give him the satisfaction. You're better than Chandler. We all are.
別讓他得逞 你比錢德棒，我們都是

244
00:17:17,430 --> 00:17:19,900
Especially me, Toby.
特別是我，托比

245
00:17:23,770 --> 00:17:27,140
-Is everything okay? -That depends.
-沒事吧？ -那得視情況而定

246
00:17:27,410 --> 00:17:31,400
-How are you and Phoebe? -Great. Thanks for introducing us.
-你跟菲比還好吧？ -很好，謝謝你介紹我們認識

247
00:17:31,610 --> 00:17:36,710
My pleasure. Okay, I'm afraid I've got some bad news.
這是我的榮幸，好吧 我得跟你宣佈一個壞消息

248
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:38,940
-Phoebe! -Monica!
-菲比 -摩妮卡

249
00:17:40,450 --> 00:17:43,250
-You're fired! -I'm breaking up with you!
-你被開除了 -我要跟你分手

250
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:45,450
I'm breaking up with you.
我要跟你分手

251
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:48,890
-You're fired. -Why?
-你被開除了 -為什麼？

252
00:17:49,100 --> 00:17:53,290
I'm sorry. I'm not ready for a relationship right now.
抱歉 我還沒有準備好跟別人長期交往

253
00:17:53,530 --> 00:17:57,900
I'm sorry too. But I like things done a certain way.
我也很抱歉 但我喜歡凡事照我的方法來做

254
00:17:58,140 --> 00:18:03,470
-The chemistry's just not right. -The chemistry thing for us too.
-我們之間的化學反應不對 -我們也一樣

255
00:18:04,950 --> 00:18:08,810
Wow. Okay.
好吧

256
00:18:10,150 --> 00:18:16,320
I realize I came on a little strong. It's because I think you're amazing.
我知道我太黏了 那是因為我覺得你很棒

257
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:22,790
I wanna tell you how much I appreciate you giving me an opportunity.
我要告訴你 我很感激你給我機會

258
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:26,560
You're the most talented chef I've ever worked for.
你是我合作過 最有天份的廚師

259
00:18:27,130 --> 00:18:29,070
Anyway..
總之…

260
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:37,610
-Tim, wait. -Yeah?
-提姆，等一下 -什麼事？

261
00:18:38,850 --> 00:18:43,650
I spoke too quickly. There's a learning curve with this job.
我話說得太快了 這份工作需要時間學習

262
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:46,510
Maybe we could try it again.
或許我們能再試一次

263
00:18:46,790 --> 00:18:50,310
Thank you so much. I know I can be better.
謝謝 我知道我可以表現的更好

264
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:56,360
And, Tim, I just want to say good luck here.
提姆 我只想說祝你好運

265
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:05,730
-Hello. -Hi.
-你好 -嗨

266
00:19:06,470 --> 00:19:08,340
How was the date?
你約會情況如何？

267
00:19:08,540 --> 00:19:14,110
I'm alone and I just bought $15 worth of candy bars. What do you think?
我一個人買了15塊錢的糖果 你覺得呢？

268
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:18,720
-What happened? -I told him I was pregnant.
-發生了什麼事？ -我告訴他我懷孕了

269
00:19:18,990 --> 00:19:23,720
-He didn't take it so well? -Well, better than you.
-他不能接受？ -他的反應比你好

270
00:19:23,990 --> 00:19:27,150
-But still not what you want. -Oh?
-但那仍不是你要的 -喔？

271
00:19:27,390 --> 00:19:30,990
Yeah. He got all weird and sputtery. Then he said:
對，他真的是嚇壞了 然後他說

272
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:34,220
"I hear those hemorrhoids are a bitch."
「我聽說長痔瘡 真的很難過」

273
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:37,430
-He sounds swell. -Doesn't he?
-說的好 -是嗎？

274
00:19:38,370 --> 00:19:42,870
You want a little cheering up? Sit down.
你要來點鼓勵嗎？坐下

275
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:47,440
Guess whose middle name is Muriel.
你猜誰中間名叫馬利歐

276
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:55,780
Chandler M. Bing. Oh, my God.
錢德·M·賓，天啊

277
00:19:59,590 --> 00:20:02,690
-I'm sorry about your date. -It's all right.
-我很遺憾你的約會沒有成功 -沒事的

278
00:20:02,930 --> 00:20:06,370
I guess I'm just done with the dating thing.
我猜我受夠了約會

279
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:11,060
Just one more thing in my life that's completely different.
那只是我生命中 另一件完全改變的事

280
00:20:11,310 --> 00:20:15,210
-This is hard. -Yeah, I know.
-這真的很難 -我瞭解

281
00:20:17,180 --> 00:20:23,240
On the other hand, in seven months you're gonna have something..
但反過來說 再過七個月你將能擁有一個孩子…

282
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:29,390
that you're gonna love more than any guy you've ever gone out with.
你對它的愛 勝過於你對其他人的感覺

283
00:20:30,290 --> 00:20:32,490
Just wait.
等著吧

284
00:20:33,730 --> 00:20:38,190
Wait until the first time your baby grabs your finger.
等到孩子第一次 抓住你的手指

285
00:20:38,430 --> 00:20:40,830
You have no idea.
你不會瞭解的

286
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:44,790
Thanks, sweetie.
謝謝你，甜心

287
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:54,440
-You wanna grab some coffee? -No. I'm gonna go eat 10 candy bars.
-你要喝杯咖啡嗎？ -不，我要去吃掉10根棒棒糖

288
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:59,410
-I thought I cheered you up. -You did. There are 20 in here.
-我還以為我讓你心情變好了 -沒錯，我剛剛買了20根

289
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:02,750
-Good night. -Good night.
-晚安 -晚安

290
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:13,870
Ross? Hey, it's Mona. From the wedding.
羅斯，我是蒙娜 我們在婚禮上見過

291
00:21:14,100 --> 00:21:16,730
-Oh, hi! -Hi.
-嗨 -嗨

292
00:21:18,170 --> 00:21:21,970
-How are you? -I'm good, except you owe me a dance.
-你好嗎？ -我很好，但你欠我一隻舞

293
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:28,040
That's right. Well, would you be interested in seeing a Ukrainian film?
沒錯，你想看烏克蘭電影嗎？

294
00:21:29,380 --> 00:21:32,150
Oh, you're serious. Sure.
